Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 00:09:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Advent ready (U13) review: link the Advent tab with
 ?tab=, the name The Table's library reads

Home, /family and a chosen tab on /family/devotions wrote ?season=advent. The Table's library (U17, built in parallel) reads ?tab= with the same values (advent, thanksgiving, holy-week), so once it replaced this page every Advent link from Home and /family would have opened the Weekly list. Both now use ?tab=; &day=N still opens and scrolls to the day here.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JuCQ8kZ25i9zRwNgk6bh4e
